# 🎓 LAST DANCE — Teacher Tribute & Teacher Tracker OS

[![Next.js 16](https://img.shields.io/badge/Next.js-16.3.4-black?style=for-the-badge&logo=next.js)](https://nextjs.org/)
[![React 19](https://img.shields.io/badge/React-19.2.8-blue?style=for-the-badge&logo=react)](https://react.dev/)
[![Tailwind CSS v4](https://img.shields.io/badge/Tailwind-v4.0-38bdf8?style=for-the-badge&logo=tailwindcss)](https://tailwindcss.com/)
[![Cartesia AI](https://img.shields.io/badge/AI%20Voice-Cartesia%20Sonic--3.6-7c3aed?style=for-the-badge)](https://cartesia.ai/)
[![Live Demo](https://img.shields.io/badge/Live%20Demo-Vercel-success?style=for-the-badge&logo=vercel)](https://last-dance-zeta.vercel.app)

> *"Our Final Year. Their Last Bell. Our Tribute."*  
> An interactive Cyberpunk / Tactical RPG tribute and recon system built to honor the legendary faculty members of **PRISM Degree & PG College** on Teacher's Day.

---

## 🌟 Live Preview

- 🌐 **Live Website**: [https://last-dance-zeta.vercel.app](https://last-dance-zeta.vercel.app)
- 📁 **GitHub Repository**: [https://github.com/Praveen007-dot/last-dance](https://github.com/Praveen007-dot/last-dance)

---

## ⚡ Key Features

### 1. 🛰️ Tactical Teacher Tracker & Satellite Recon
- **Interactive OpenStreetMap / Leaflet Integration**: A customized retro CRT radar map centered on **PRISM Degree & PG College, Visakhapatnam** (`17.730435° N, 83.308419° E`).
- **Retro HUD Interface**: Spidey/Tactical double-bordered capsule pill badge, CRT scanlines, live target tracking coordinates, radar ping blips, and location dossier modal.
- **Audio Telemetry**: Dynamic audio status updates and scan feedback for each faculty discovery.

### 2. 🎴 RPG Character Tribute Cards
- **10 Legendary Faculty Members**: Comprehensive dossiers with tailored stats (Intelligence, Patience, Strictness, Inspiration, Aura, Humour).
- **Special Abilities & Mood Badges**: Playful abilities like *Strict Mode ON*, *Quantum Physics Mastery*, *Pin-to-Pin Breakdown*, and *Placement Champion*.
- **Authentic Campus Dialogue**: Telugu & Tenglish localized voice lines capturing campus inside jokes, quirks, and mentorship memories.

### 3. 🎙️ AI Voiceover & Multilingual Audio
- **Cartesia AI Integration**: Powered by Cartesia Sonic-3.6 for high-fidelity custom cloned voice generation.
- **Edge TTS & Dual-Mode Fallback**: Bundled pre-rendered high-definition MP3 voice files in `public/audio/voices/` ensuring 100% offline and low-latency playback even when offline or during high traffic.

### 4. 🎬 Cinematic Interactive Flow
1. **System Boot Sequence**: Terminal initialization with retro typewriter telemetry and audio cues.
2. **Hero Landing Page**: Cyberpunk neon title banner with ambient background audio controls.
3. **Satellite Scan Overlay**: Radar sweep calibration detecting faculty signatures.
4. **Teacher Tracker Radar**: Interactive campus map displaying faculty markers.
5. **Detection Sequence**: High-tech HUD lock-on animation when selecting a teacher.
6. **RPG Dossier Card**: Interactive character cards with audio play/pause controls.
7. **Final Tribute Ceremony**: Celebration with particle fireworks, photo wall, and heartfelt final appreciation speech.

