## 🛠️ Tech Stack

- **Framework**: [Next.js 16 (Turbopack)](https://nextjs.org/)
- **UI Library**: [React 19](https://react.dev/)
- **Styling**: [Tailwind CSS v4](https://tailwindcss.com/)
- **Animations**: [Framer Motion](https://www.framer.com/motion/)
- **Mapping**: [Leaflet](https://leafletjs.com/) & [React-Leaflet](https://react-leaflet.js.org/)
- **Audio & TTS**: [Cartesia AI](https://cartesia.ai/) + [Edge TTS](https://github.com/rany2/edge-tts)
- **Deployment**: [Vercel](https://vercel.com/)

---

## 📂 Project Structure

```text
last-dance/
├── app/
│   ├── api/
│   │   └── tts/route.ts          # Cartesia AI TTS serverless endpoint
│   ├── globals.css               # Retro HUD variables & CRT scanline filters
│   ├── layout.tsx                # App root metadata and fonts
│   └── page.tsx                  # Main interactive multi-phase controller
├── components/
│   ├── Audio/                    # Ambient background music and audio manager
│   ├── Boot/                     # Terminal boot sequence animation
│   ├── Detection/                # Tactical lock-on animation overlay
│   ├── FinalTribute/             # Celebration screen and final photo wall
│   ├── Hero/                     # Neon hero banner & particle field
│   ├── Map/                      # Tactical radar HUD, Leaflet map, scan overlay
│   └── RPG/                      # RPG Dossier cards, stats, ability badges
├── data/
│   ├── teachers.ts               # Faculty database (stats, bio, dialogues)
│   └── trackerConfig.ts          # Campus coordinates, codenames, and HUD config
├── hooks/
│   ├── useCartesiaSpeech.ts      # Audio synthesis and voice caching hook
│   └── useTeacherFlow.ts         # Global app state machine (phases 1-7)
├── public/
│   ├── audio/                    # BGM, marvel theme, and telemetry sounds
│   │   └── voices/               # Pre-rendered high-definition faculty voiceovers
│   └── teachers/                 # Faculty portrait photographs
└── scripts/                      # Automated voice synthesis scripts
```

